# BrandBlitz Trivy Ignore File
# Document accepted CVE false positives or exceptions here.
# Format: CVE-YYYY-XXXX exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# To run the Trivy scan locally:
#   docker run --rm -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock aquasec/trivy image <image-name>
#
# Example:
#   docker run --rm -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock aquasec/trivy image brandblitz-api:local
